    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Use a high‑resolution camera or mobile app to record the bike from all angles, noting existing damages, tire wear, and chassis integrity. Upload the images to the parcel tracking system so the rider can track bike parcel in train and verify that the condition matches on delivery.</p>
