      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><h3>Destination Delivery Handover for Two‑Wheeler &amp; Motorcycle</h3>
<p>The handover at the destination is the final checkpoint that guarantees the vehicle reaches the consignee in the exact condition documented at pickup. It combines a daylight visual re‑inspection, precise odometer verification, and a formal signed sign‑off, creating a transparent record that protects both transporter and recipient.</p>
