    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Upon arrival, the two‑wheeler is examined under natural light to reveal any surface imperfections, dents, scratches, or paint anomalies that might be missed in artificial lighting. The inspector compares the live condition with the original pickup photographs, noting any discrepancies side‑by‑side.</p>
