    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Signed Condition Sign‑off:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">After the visual and mileage checks, the consignee reviews the compiled findings. The recipient signs a condition acknowledgment form that lists the verified odometer reading, references the pickup photos, and confirms acceptance of the vehicle’s current state.</p>
